<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Change a Life With Just $10</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="overlay">
      <h1>Change a Life With Just $10</h1>
      <p>100% of your gift brings clean water to real communities — because every human deserves safe water, and every student can help make that happen.</p>
      <button class="cta">💧 Donate Now</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="goal">
    <h2>Goal: Raise awareness without guilt.</h2>
    <p class="stats">771 million people don’t have access to clean water. That’s nearly 1 in 10 people on the planet.</p>
    <p class="subtext">Impact + Transparency: Build trust with stats and clear evidence.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>🌍 1,000+ projects funded by students</li>
      <li>📍 Serving 29 countries</li>
      <li>📡 Every donation geo-tracked and reported back</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="solution">
    <div class="left">
      <h3>Solution</h3>
      <p>The solution is very simple — show how charity: water makes real change.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="right">
      <blockquote>“We build sustainable water solutions in the world’s most water-stressed communities — and we send 100% of donations directly to projects.”</blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-now">
    <h3>Why You / Why Now</h3>
    <p>You don’t need to be rich or famous to make change. College students around the world are already stepping up — starting with just $10.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="get-involved">
    <h3>“Be the ripple that starts the wave.”</h3>
    <div class="actions">
      <div>
        <h4>Donate</h4>
        <p>No matter the amount, your donation will make a big difference.</p>
        <button>Donate</button>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Volunteer</h4>
        <p>Join our community outreach and awareness campaigns.</p>
        <button>Sign up</button>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Spread the word</h4>
        <p>Help us spread advocacy to your friends, family, and colleagues.</p>
        <button>Share page</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <h4>Contact us</h4>
    <p>📞 (123) 456-7890</p>
    <p>📧 charityproject.com</p>
    <p>📍 7150 Fulton Avenue, North Hollywood, CA</p>
    <p>🔗 Social: 
      <a href="#">Facebook</a> | 
      <a href="#">Instagram</a>
    </p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
